{"status":"ok","dna":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"ai-mw8o1g8i-pct","name":"スカイステップ・ジェットシューズ","category":"mobility","purpose":"両足のソール下の推進ユニットで体を浮かせ、目標地点まで空中を移動するための靴型デバイスです。","mode":"dream","appearance":"safety_orange","parts":[{"id":"sole_left","type":"body","position":[-0.12,0.05,0],"scale":[0.11,0.06,0.3]},{"id":"sole_right","type":"body","position":[0.12,0.05,0],"scale":[0.11,0.06,0.3]},{"id":"thruster_left","type":"thruster","position":[-0.12,-0.03,0],"scale":[0.1,0.08,0.1]},{"id":"thruster_right","type":"thruster","position":[0.12,-0.03,0],"scale":[0.1,0.08,0.1]},{"id":"stabilizer_center","type":"stabilizer","position":[0,0.04,-0.1],"scale":[0.08,0.04,0.08]},{"id":"sensor_front","type":"sensor","position":[0,0.06,0.17],"scale":[0.04,0.03,0.03]}],"behaviors":[{"type":"hover","parameters":{"lift":0.6,"maxHeight":1.5}},{"type":"move_forward","parameters":{"thrust":0.4,"speedLimit":1.2}},{"type":"stabilize","targetPart":"stabilizer_center","parameters":{"stabilizationStrength":0.7}},{"type":"avoid_obstacle","parameters":{"detectionRange":1.5}}],"constraints":{"maxParts":12,"maxSpeed":3},"revision":1,"parentRevision":null},"designPoints":["揚力は0.6と余裕を持たせ、最大高度は1.5mに抑えて離陸しやすさと低空での練習を両立させました。","推力0.4・速度上限1.2m/sと控えめにし、目標地点で行き過ぎにくくしています。","横風で体が揺れやすいため、姿勢安定の強さを0.7と高めに設定しました。","リアリティモードでは人を持ち上げる必要電力がとても大きく出るので、推進ユニットの大きさとの関係を確かめてみてください。"],"message":"浮遊と推進で空を移動する、左右ソールに推進ユニットを備えた飛行シューズを設計しました。","model":"claude-opus-5-5"}